DDEESSCCRRIIPPTTIIOONN
     The ccccppmmiicc driver provides support for the “Intel” Crystal Cove Power
     Management ICs.  These devices have temperature and voltage sensors and
     provide power management functionality.  Sensor values are made available
     to acpi(4) to support Thermal Zones.

